<h2 id=3D"intuition">Intuition</h2>
<p>Our goal is to check if enrollment into all courses is possible. Let=E2=
=80=99s start by identifying which situations make enrollment impossible.</=
p>
<p>Consider a simple case where there are just two courses. A scenario wher=
e enrollment into all courses is impossible occurs when each course is a pr=
