<p>What do we notice about these cases and their graphical representations?=
 They both have a circular relationship: a cycle. This highlights that it=
=E2=80=99s impossible to enroll in all courses if there exists a circular d=
ependency between courses. In other words, <strong>there must not be a cycl=
